{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/878832-when-you-should-not-go-loud-an-instructional-video","id":878832,"title":"When you should NOT Go Loud - an instructional video.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-30T10:04:10-07:00","id":878832,"title":"When you should NOT Go Loud - an instructional video.","content":"&quot;Hey youngsters, Mr.Exposition here! Now I have been told that all of you have been newly Fallen and have a lot of questions about this new state of existence - the most common of them revolving around the phenomenon of Going Loud. 'Mr. Exposition,' I hear you bright eyed kiddos say ' I have the ability to attain the power of a physical god at any point at the low, low price of my current mortal identity - what can I do with it? What should I do with it?'. Well fear not my John Hancocks and Jane Does, your questions have been heard and as a representative of the International Cover Preservation Association of America ( ICPAA) it is my job to tell you what to do and not do with your full power!<br /> <br /> To begin with, let's start with what are the reasons you should NOT Go Loud for:<br /> <br /> 1. Lighting your cigars<br /> 2. Lighting your friend's cigars<br /> 3. Performing Magic Tricks<br /> 4. Building a Distopian Utopia<br /> 5. Building a Utopian Utopia<br /> 6. Having Sex<br /> 7. Playing Dodgeball<br /> 8.Having Sex while Playing Dodgeball<br /> 9. Plotting the Downfall of your enemies<br /> 10. Opening Pickle Jars<br /> 11. Breezing through Post Operation Paperwork<br /> 12. Helping your father-in-law move furniture up/down stairs<br /> 13. Mocking Mages<br /> 14. Worrying Werewolves<br /> 15. Punking Prometheans<br /> 16. Vaping Vampires<br /> 17. Spooking Sin-Eaters<br /> 18.Mollifying Mummies<br /> 19.Cheating Changelings<br /> 20. (bullet)Hosing Hunters<br /> 21. Determining How Many Licks does it take to get to the tootsie roll center of a Tootsie Pop<br /> 22. Stretching Your Legs<br /> 23. Winning the Lottery<br /> 24. Chucking Wood<br /> 25. Becoming God.<br /> <br /> Now here are some reasons you SHOULD Go Loud for:<br /> <br /> 1. Heroic Last Stands<br /> 2. Desperate, suicidal Last Stands<br /> 3. Last Stands in general<br /> 4. Bitch-slapping Beasts<br /> 5. Being a Sacrificial Lamb so your Ring can escape.<br /> <br /> So remember, just follow these guidelines and everything will be okay!*<br /> <br /> I'm Mr. Exposition with the ICPAA, and until next time stay vigiliant!&quot;<br /> <br /> *The ICPAA does not condone reckless use,misuse, or use of Going Loud under normal circumstances. Please consult your doctor before Going Loud to discuss possible side effects. This has been a ICPAA certified message, Copyright June 12th, 1995.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-30T11:35:50-07:00","id":878886,"title":"","content":"Alternatively, build a cover for the express purpose of going loud (takes it's due time) and raze the shit of all the infrastructures you can find. Then watch as the intradimentional Cthulhu-like monsters obliterate reality unimpeded.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,